      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/1664809-034",
      "text": "If US law requires disclosure of information that another country's law prohibits from being disclosed, whether for privacy or other reasons, there could be a true conflict of law and a credible case that the United States is in breach of international law.",
