      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/1765901-019",
      "text": "Porsche could be exposed to substantial U.S. sanctions even though neither its own common stock nor Volkswagen's traded in the United States, solely because of swap agreements to which Porsche was not a party.",
      "claim_type": "failure",
