    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:1998455-024:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "The combination of investor interest and an underdeveloped regulatory structure in the United States, pertaining to this market segment, could present a unique opportunity to experiment with contingent capital designs and their possible application in corpo- rate governance of SIFIs.",
