    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2029983-029:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "While the largest cases, such as Shell and Fortis, would probably still provide sufficient lev- erage for the plaintiffs to result in large settlements with de- fendants, smaller cases may not be successfully settled in Dutch courts.",
      "text_sha256": "0122678fe50a788537a369057300540b686829c103eb023bcb8fea3543ba8e67",
      "source_sha256": "fde2ff611420eb283cbb49a6b681a2ae8efa2b4603ae71480e2d91483f0295f2",
