    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2267560-029:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "the competition between legislators does not necessarily provide a feedback process in the sense of cooperation, (Kirchner, Painter and Kaal 2005; Carbonara and Parisi 2008; Kerber 2000; Heine and Kerber 2002), it can nevertheless provide incentives for public rulemakers to consider regulatory",
