      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Dynamic regulation helps rulemakers anticipate how institutions will react to circumstances as they arise because the feedback process provides decentralized, timely, and institution-specific information for rulemaking. Rules are adjusted ex-ante in anticipation of future contingencies.",
