      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2273857-061",
      "text": "Prosecutors negotiating deferred prosecution agreements may lack the expertise needed to negotiate high level corporate governance changes such as personnel changes and internal corporate and compliance procedures.",
