    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2389416-005:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "However, while Dodd-Frank Act compliance costs affect the profitability of hedge fund advisors' investment management companies, registration and disclosure requirements under the Dodd-Frank Act do not seem to affect the returns of hedge funds (Kaal 2013a).",
