      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2486570-026",
      "text": "High quality and effective preemptive remedial measures are themselves part of good corporate governance and can help a corporation avoid investigation, prosecution, and the execution of a non or deferred prosecution agreement.",
