    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2486570-026:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "High-quality effective preemptive reme- dial measures are part of good corporate governance and can help avoid inves- tigations and prosecutions and the associated execution of N/DPAs.",
