    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2486570-031:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Because of the large reputational implications of prosecution and N/DPA execution, corporate wrongdoers are unlikely to favor \"regulation by prosecution\" to regulation by legislation.",
