    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2486570-035:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "If corporate wrongdo- ing is not the result of lacking corporate governance, it seems possible that N/DPA related governance reform is just a method of settlement rather than a lasting re- form effort.",
