    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2629451-031",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2629451-031",
      "text": "The market values N/DPA governance changes during the term because those changes effectively address the underlying corporate wrongdoing and its damage to goodwill and reputation while reducing the likelihood of continuing fines and litigation.",
