    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2629451-031:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "The market assesses the governance changes during the term of the N/DPA as beneficial for market value because it effectively addresses corporate wrongdoing and the associated negative effects on goodwill and reputation while lowering the likelihood of continuing fines and litigation.",
