    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2714974-021",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2714974-021",
      "text": "Until the SEC finalizes verification rules and gives a clear, comprehensive definition of the reasonable steps an issuer must take, issuers cannot determine at the time of sale whether their verification attempts made general solicitation permissible.",
