    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2714974-021:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Without appropriate SEC guidance, issuers will have difficulty ascertaining if their verification attempts at the time of the sale of securities made GSGA permissible.",
