      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2740477-032",
      "text": "The existing framework for optimal rules is self reinforcing: it perpetuates rulemaking processes that produce more optimal rules requiring costly revision, updating, and revocation, so suboptimal rules and suboptimal processes reproduce each other.",
