      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2811718-017",
      "text": "While some courts found that a complete lack of investor due diligence can amount to securities fraud or breach of contract, and that lacking due diligence can breach fiduciary duties, the majority of courts evaluate private fund due diligence issues in the context of misrepresentation.",
