      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2811718-026",
      "text": "Funds of funds claimed to select the best managers through skilled due diligence and charged standard 2 and 20 fee structures for that service, while in reality depositing the vast majority of their capital into Madoff's opaque fund.",
