      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2811718-033",
      "text": "Expert consensus in the examined litigation record converges on a set of standard due diligence practices, beginning with qualitative review of firm marketing materials, offering documents, subscription documents, and manager track records, and onsite manager meetings.",
