      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2831040-025",
      "text": "Early regulatory intervention becomes unnecessary in a dynamic regulatory framework, because the regulatory challenges associated with innovation would become transparent in real time through improved, decentralized information and feedback effects.",
