    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2939127-017:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "That model also allows node verification of transactions without compromising the privacy of the parties and is therefore arguably safer than a traditional model that requires third-party intermediary validation of transactions.",
