    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2998097-006:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Increased stress tests, Value at Risk, and Monte Carlo scenarios for financial intermediaries to private investments funds necessarily use historical data and are less valuable as an indicator of high risk sensitivity for future events.39",
