    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:2998097-010:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Such proposed investor suitability standards would require independent verification of investors' ability to evaluate highly complex financial products and investment risk, rendering wealth as a proxy for sophistication redundant for investor eligibility.54",
