      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2998097-015",
      "text": "The second survey found long-term negative effects of Title IV: 34.9 percent of respondents expected it to affect the industry over the next five years through additional expenses, and 32.6 percent expected it to create barriers to entry for new private fund market entrants.",
      "claim_type": "empirical",
