      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/2998097-019",
      "text": "Rules become adaptable when institutions and rulemaking processes integrate feedback effects, including feedback between industry and regulators, that generate timely, relevant, and decentralized information before rules are finalized.",
