    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-018:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Blockchain technology provides an alternative governance mechanism that eliminates agency costs - the principal's cost of supervising agents - by creating trust in the contractual relationship between the principal and the agent.",
