      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3373393-024",
      "text": "Cryptographic hashes increase blockchain security and remove the trust barriers in agency relationships that otherwise require monitoring of agents and generate agency costs.",
