    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-031:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "the DAO token holders will desire to perform such optimization tasks as it is in their very interest to do so to help increase the value of the DAO tokens.",
      "text_sha256": "0f6ac86316c85f52ba909f5e22568609479303681100d785341a42b9a5091b4c",
      "source_sha256": "4d1424b9ba9aff8a61bc7a0dddd02cded93785e5843685dde76c07dcdb23961e",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-033",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3373393-033",
      "text": "Non-performance reputational penalties in a DAO are entirely free from racial or cultural biases, because the token holders imposing them are unlikely to even know each other.",
      "claim_type": "mechanism",
      "topics": [
        "dao",
        "reputation"
      ],
      "scope_conditions": [
        "DAOs where token holders are pseudonymous and mutually unknown"
      ],
      "attribution_class": "source_derived",
      "attribution_status": "directly_attributable_to_wulf_a_kaal",
      "verification_status": "current",
      "source_quote_status": "present_in_canonical_claim_record",
      "source_quote_individual_match_status": "not_recomputed_by_pilot",
      "confidence": "argued",
      "relevance_score": 42
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-033:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Crucially, non-performance reputational penalties are entirely free from racial or cultural biases and associated implications as the token holders are unlikely to even know each other.",
      "text_sha256": "35643604b1af0e915361b739640c831ae11f2a1224313eea3f3b40613df6c4d9",
      "source_sha256": "4d1424b9ba9aff8a61bc7a0dddd02cded93785e5843685dde76c07dcdb23961e",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-036",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3373393-036",
      "text": "The core issues that afflict centralized governance solutions, including information asymmetries, censorship, opportunism of agents, breaches of fiduciary duties, and fraud, can only be truly removed if and when a truly decentralized public blockchain emerges that is scalable and fully secure.",
      "claim_type": "condition",
      "topics": [
        "decentralization",
        "consensus-and-security",
        "blockchain"
      ],
      "scope_conditions": [
        "decentralized rather than centralized blockchain implementations"
      ],
      "attribution_class": "source_derived",
      "attribution_status": "directly_attributable_to_wulf_a_kaal",
      "verification_status": "current",
      "source_quote_status": "present_in_canonical_claim_record",
      "source_quote_individual_match_status": "not_recomputed_by_pilot",
      "confidence": "argued",
      "relevance_score": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-036:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "and fraud or third-party interference, can only be truly removed to fully reform the agency relationship if and when a truly decentralized public blockchain emerges that is scalable and fully secure.",
      "text_sha256": "f586b8406921340105511a56f567fb54b3d084816a5f34be9ff0e78378e561aa",
      "source_sha256": "4d1424b9ba9aff8a61bc7a0dddd02cded93785e5843685dde76c07dcdb23961e",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-038",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3373393-038",
      "text": "Without a decentralized human backstop to code, the immutability of the blockchain and its cryptographic security systems may not be able to create truly transactional guarantees and trust between principals and agents.",
      "claim_type": "failure",
      "topics": [
        "reputation",
        "smart-contracts"
      ],
      "scope_conditions": [
        "complex agency relationships"
      ],
      "attribution_class": "source_derived",
      "attribution_status": "directly_attributable_to_wulf_a_kaal",
      "verification_status": "current",
      "source_quote_status": "present_in_canonical_claim_record",
      "source_quote_individual_match_status": "not_recomputed_by_pilot",
      "confidence": "argued",
      "relevance_score": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-038:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Similarly, without a decentralized human backstop to code, the immutability of the blockchain and its cryptographic security systems may not be able to create truly transactional guarantees and trust between principals and agents in the integrity of their contractual relationship.",
      "text_sha256": "7a3409ede919fcf39b7176fbd76f55016f6917061824eb3ad5c50d66eefd215a",
      "source_sha256": "4d1424b9ba9aff8a61bc7a0dddd02cded93785e5843685dde76c07dcdb23961e",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3373393-039",
