    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3406323-012:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Trust can help lower transaction costs but it also increases consumer and overall market confidence and certainty, which facilitate economies of scale that may not be possible in centralized structures.",
