      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3406323-035",
      "text": "Reputation avoids the recentralization dynamic that afflicts currencies because it must be earned and can be lost yet cannot be converted into a fungible store of value exchangeable for goods.",
