    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3409548-003:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "The current technology used in hedge fund trading is hard coded by a human. In contrast, a deep learning AI machine learning algorithm can be given a simple command and automatically find a result based on data.",
