      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3409548-009",
      "text": "Repeated use of the same data set by data scientists creates an overfitting risk: the training model overfits the test set, which limits the performance of the applied model on a different dataset.",
