    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3409548-009:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "When data scientists use the same data set repetitively a risk exists that the training model will overfit the test set of data, which can limit the performance of the applied model on a different dataset.",
