      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3409548-019",
      "text": "The Northern Trust and IBM blockchain removes a specific inefficiency in private equity deal practice by letting all involved parties in a deal look at a single compiled version of the transaction and all data relating to it, rather than reconciling multiple copies of the deal documents.",
