      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3409548-024",
      "text": "Because blockchain is transparent, verifiable, self-authenticating and self-enforcing, transactions can settle instantaneously at near zero cost, and it is this combination plus technology-driven democratized trust that drove the financial industry's large blockchain investments out of fear of obsolescence.",
