      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3606663-015",
      "text": "Institutional investors face a distinct barrier beyond volatility: fiduciary responsibility to their clients limits the type of risk they may take on, and the lack of custody solutions recognized by regulators compounds the problem.",
