    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3606663-033:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "\"Without central entity involvement, who should be held accountable for potential wrongdoing can become unclear. Who do you resort to for help? When problems arise, no central party can take actions to freeze transactions, fix problems and restore normal operations.",
