      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3782192-030",
      "text": "The Maghribi traders built a sophisticated decentralized trade network using the information technology of their era plus reputation, and later farmers used dynamic governance designs to create the most powerful decentralized organization in history.",
