      "text": "centralized authorities have a long rec- ord of using crises to justify the introduction of monitoring tools that outlast their original purpose.",
      "text_sha256": "599edd5f4845f0ab2276d3daf035d6bb29d2412de175f6665c5330ff0ca5c9d6",
