    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3782205-025:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Executive (automated policing), legislative (non-automated protocol de- velopment), and judicial (both automated and non-automated dispute resolution) governance must be considered.",
