      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3782217-036",
      "text": "Reviewing through references enables punishment and reward in DAOs, which shifts members' motivation away from immediate rewards toward the future and encourages delayed gratification and sacrifice for the good of the group.",
