      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3782220-038",
      "text": "The strength of a decentralized organization is measured by summing the power of each member in their individual autonomy, modified by the group's ability to organize and effect its goals in the larger society.",
