    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3808852-010",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3808852-010",
      "text": "Agency theory and the existing legal framework have failed to resolve the core agency conflict arising from the separation of ownership and control, so peaceable and productive coordination of human behavior remains wanting.",
      "claim_type": "failure",
      "topics": [
        "governance-design",
        "corporate-governance"
      ],
      "scope_conditions": [
        "applies to limited liability entities and their constituents"
      ],
      "attribution_class": "source_derived",
      "attribution_status": "directly_attributable_to_wulf_a_kaal",
      "verification_status": "current",
      "source_quote_status": "present_in_canonical_claim_record",
      "source_quote_individual_match_status": "not_recomputed_by_pilot",
      "confidence": "argued",
      "relevance_score": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3808852-010:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Theory and practice have not successfully addressed the outstanding issues. For example, the core agency conflicts emanating from the separation of ownership (shareholder principal) and control (manager agent) cannot be fully addressed by the existing theoretical and legal framework.",
      "text_sha256": "bccda8559aa62ba7d2e8ef90661f5d47e742a1d162bfdf521403f4ab724e3464",
      "source_sha256": "31e91158fdeefebc2f0be54ebf89751f7cdd4c89ecea932888f5ba9be6b1caba",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3808852-012",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3808852-012",
      "text": "Organizational decentralization can raise economic performance without new technology: Jack Welch's separation of GE business units, each with its own profit-and-loss statement and full accountability, allowed efficient and profitable operation and GE's market value skyrocketed as a result.",
      "claim_type": "empirical",
      "topics": [
        "ai-and-agents",
        "decentralization",
        "institutional-design"
      ],
      "scope_conditions": [
        "pre and post internet era corporate structures"
      ],
      "attribution_class": "source_derived",
      "attribution_status": "directly_attributable_to_wulf_a_kaal",
      "verification_status": "current",
      "source_quote_status": "present_in_canonical_claim_record",
      "source_quote_individual_match_status": "not_recomputed_by_pilot",
      "confidence": "evidenced",
      "relevance_score": 39
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3808852-012:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Welch's method enabled each business unit to be run efficiently and profitably, while allowing unit heads significant flexibility and independence. GE's market value skyrocketed as a result of its decentralization of business units.",
      "text_sha256": "5330c32f747cdf0007e5c590e3acf8922728eef7ef7bd2bb0b3cc3fe3048c335",
      "source_sha256": "31e91158fdeefebc2f0be54ebf89751f7cdd4c89ecea932888f5ba9be6b1caba",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3808852-014",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3808852-014",
      "text": "eBay's user rating system is visibly flawed and illustrates the need for a decentralized reputation verification system, yet no entity or individual has produced a better technology, and those decentralized ratings remained eBay's biggest competitive advantage.",
      "claim_type": "failure",
      "topics": [
        "reputation"
      ],
      "scope_conditions": [],
      "attribution_class": "source_derived",
      "attribution_status": "directly_attributable_to_wulf_a_kaal",
      "verification_status": "current",
      "source_quote_status": "present_in_canonical_claim_record",
      "source_quote_individual_match_status": "not_recomputed_by_pilot",
      "confidence": "argued",
      "relevance_score": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3808852-014:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "While the user ratings eBay uses clearly have flaws (that illustrate the need for a decentralized reputation verification system), so far, no entity or individual has been able to come up with a better technology.",
      "text_sha256": "8385bc089d59ac533519ef9bb52ad8ff7712ad2fc393b112b4156d89a1bf1d10",
      "source_sha256": "31e91158fdeefebc2f0be54ebf89751f7cdd4c89ecea932888f5ba9be6b1caba",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3808852-015",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3808852-015",
      "text": "Decentralized autonomous organizations epitomize organizational decentralization because the first DAO, built purely on code and smart contracts with no incorporation, physical address, or headquarters, entirely removed all traditional control mechanisms employed by principals in agency relationships.",
      "claim_type": "definitional",
      "topics": [
        "dao",
        "smart-contracts",
        "decentralization",
        "institutional-design"
      ],
      "scope_conditions": [
        "describes the first DAO launched in May 2016"
