    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3931933-035:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Through this balancing of validator SHAS stakes and reputation, HSPoS attains an equilibrium of incentives for validators to: a. attain economic success as validators, and",
