    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3949098-002:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Reputation tokens that are utilized in decentralized finance are more meaningful than traditional identity verification metrics, and much easier to value. Accordingly, decentralized protocols that use reputation metrics will require less collateralization than in traditional protocols.",
