    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:4067783-035:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Of course, these attempts are all falling victim to web-of-trust theory that has been proven to not work long-term because the sockpuppet attacks that are inevitable in this design.",
