      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/4529715-002",
      "text": "Each DAO in the dataset was given a score between zero and ten by the analyzing teams on each of six factors: Decentralization, Work to Earn, Attack Resistance, Regulatory Compliance, Governance, and Organizational Communication.",
