    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:4755632-016:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Gamification can be utilized to improve data quality through mechanisms like consensus-based voting or peer review. Workers can review and rate each other's contributions, earning points or recognition for accurate and consistent work.",
