      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/4755632-019",
      "text": "The collective of reviewers in legacy code review is not incentivized to find flaws in the code, because the review is treated as the work product of the initial reviewer with minor input from follow-up reviewers rather than as a product of the collective.",
