      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/4796714-037",
      "text": "A decentralized data validation layer applied to pretrained models is efficient but structurally limited: because it cannot drive significant changes to the model's core design or training approach, it leaves the model more attack prone.",
