    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:4900878-003:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Quantum algorithms, such as Shor's algorithm, can factor these numbers exponentially faster, potentially rendering existing cryptographic methods obsolete.",
