    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:4900880-006:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "This development necessitates the creation of quantum-resistant cryptographic protocols to secure transactions and data in the quantum economy. The shift towards quantum-safe cryptography will be critical to maintaining trust and security in digital financial systems and decentralized networks.",
