      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/5095633-035",
      "text": "Because Fetch.ai's reputation metrics do not adjust to evolving ethical, legal, and community standards, the platform risks entrenching biases and outdated practices.",
