      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/5095633-037",
      "text": "Numeraire's staking and prediction-based reputation mechanism, tuned to predictive accuracy, overlooks the ethical and contextual concerns that characterize AI dataset governance.",
