      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/5095633-038",
      "text": "A single reputation score, as used by DcentAI, cannot capture the interdependencies among privacy concerns, domain-specific regulation, and real-time ethical updates that dataset governance requires.",
