    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:5095633-038:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "The current framework may struggle to capture interdependencies between various data facets\u2014such as privacy concerns, domain-specific regulations, and real-time ethical updates\u2014within a single reputation score.",
