    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:5225296-011:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Behavioral economics provides a lens for understanding this shift: reputation acts as a social incentive, complementing monetary rewards and fostering cooperation in trustless environments",
