      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/5225296-020",
      "text": "Recursive zk-SNARK optimizations compress proof generation from seconds to milliseconds while preserving constant-time verification, which is what makes zero-knowledge voting deployable in a protocol running microsecond-scale reputation updates.",
