    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:5225296-028:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "In reputation-driven systems, this threat is amplified as influence stems from behavioral metrics rather than stake, enabling attackers to mimic legitimate activity across numerous identities",
