      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/5225296-030",
      "text": "Cryptography alone is insufficient for a reputation-based consensus system: SPoS's cryptographic toolkit resists direct tampering, but reputation-based exploits require separate strategic countermeasures.",
