      "confidence": "argued",
      "relevance_score": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:5554218-018:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Escrow mechanisms, while effective for automation, require reliable oracles and robust governance to prevent manipulation, as emphasized by Zhao and Chen.",
      "text_sha256": "c18fba05252577e5ba49c5680945a89f836238e792cf1bd17cee127c2bbac19c",
      "source_sha256": "55738b4035a91b70aa2ddaa127552fe4b373ec641afee2719fbdcabebdcbea44",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:5554218-019",
      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/5554218-019",
      "text": "The code is law paradigm departs from existing legal systems in three linked ways: it shifts authority from sovereign institutions to technical protocols, replaces interpretive flexibility with deterministic enforcement, and substitutes technological neutrality for normative deliberation.",
      "claim_type": "mechanism",
      "topics": [
        "smart-contracts",
        "governance-design"
      ],
      "scope_conditions": [
        "blockchain and smart contract architectures presented as self-sufficient regulation"
      ],
      "attribution_class": "source_derived",
      "attribution_status": "directly_attributable_to_wulf_a_kaal",
      "verification_status": "current",
      "source_quote_status": "present_in_canonical_claim_record",
      "source_quote_individual_match_status": "not_recomputed_by_pilot",
      "confidence": "argued",
      "relevance_score": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:5554218-019:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "fundamentally contrasts with existing legal systems by shifting authority from sovereign institutions to technical protocols, replacing interpretive flexibility with deterministic enforcement, and substituting normative deliberation with technological neutrality.",
      "text_sha256": "5facb7107045dc6ce413babbf9031decaa6136c3554ba5134cbe4320409887f9",
      "source_sha256": "55738b4035a91b70aa2ddaa127552fe4b373ec641afee2719fbdcabebdcbea44",
      "locator_status": "exact_quote_without_page_locator"
    },
    {
