    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:5554218-037:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "For example, participants who act in good faith earn reputation credits, while those engaging in opportunistic actions face penalties, mitigating the \"take the money and run\" mentality fostered by anonymity.",
