      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/5583610-003",
      "text": "Liquid Equity Rewards is defined as a blockchain enabled system that grants verified holders of stock or tokenized equity time-weighted, utility-only rewards rather than financial yield.",
