    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:5887242-035:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "For example, a previously unknown practitioner in Singapore who consistently drafts superior quantum-ownership clauses can, within months, outrank established professors or former regulators\u2014purely because the Validation Pool record proves their predictive accuracy and value added.",
