      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/6244278-013",
      "text": "Agent entry into the ecosystem should be permissionless, requiring only evidence, stake, and consequence, through an 'economic apprenticeship' in which an agent stakes small amounts, observes outcomes, and progressively builds reputational capital.",
