    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:6244278-027:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "when reputation is both the system's aggregation weight and the agent's optimization target, the equilibrium behavior includes properties, such as consistency, collaborative integrity, systemic stewardship, that transcend narrow task optimization.",
