      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/6269518-018",
      "text": "Validator-verified citation correction is insufficient as a standalone remedy because validators may identify obviously missing citations or inflated self-citation yet lack the domain-specific knowledge to assess fine-grained attribution weights.",
