    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:6269518-038:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "First, the proof of Theorem 3b assumes that validators can meaningfully assess citation accuracy, which may be challenging in highly specialized domains. Future work should explore automated citation verification tools, such as semantic similarity analysis between work products",
      "text_sha256": "3aaffa56de83c672c3046c66d22d34c459fd1262d0283c5fbfe33ece1da87a79",
