      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/6607458-032",
      "text": "The delegated-acts and code-of-practice mechanisms in recent artificial-intelligence statutes are only partial steps toward dynamic regulation because they remain tethered to legislative revision cycles running far slower than the technology they govern.",
