      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "The agent action space is closed: workers select among existing postings. This collapses to the Neoclassical labor market with reputation weighting, which is to say, to the framework whose expiration The Collapse of Scarcity Economics (Kaal 2026b) demonstrates.",
      "text_sha256": "6aa2265e66807ec529daa95aa55432052c61272f6c917696b1d25a6cb325e01b",
