      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/6655138-022",
      "text": "Reflection reputation must be bounded above as a fraction of total agent reputation, otherwise a meta-reputation aristocracy emerges in which agents specialize entirely in reflecting on others' allocations without contributing to the first-order surfaces.",
      "claim_type": "design",
      "topics": [
