      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/6655138-043",
      "text": "Generation parity is a governance principle with no analog in Ostrom's eight: it requires that reputation accrual rates on the first-order generative surfaces, on the execution surface, and on the cross-surface reflection surface lie in a triple ratio bounded above and below.",
