    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:6655138-043:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Generation parity requires that the rate of reputation accrual on first-order generative surfaces (\u03a3_J, \u03a3_T, \u03a3_K, \u03a3_D), on the execution surface (\u03a3_E), and on the cross-surface reflection surface (\u03a3_R) lie in a triple ratio bounded above and below.",
