    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:7314479-010:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "What such a core does not supply is a shared answer to responsibility, to remedy, or to value attribution, because those are settled between the parties to a particular outcome rather than at the boundary of a particular call.",
