      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/7314479-028",
      "text": "Chronicle entries at commit 2d920ce carry exactly five fields with no workflow identifier, parent-entry reference, principal identity, or correlation field, so the records of a multi-tool workflow cannot be joined.",
